==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 7.67 seconds<sup>230f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 8.67 seconds<sup>260f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 29.33 seconds<sup>880f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kory]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Gabriel]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns.
**1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns.
**1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns.
**1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

